==Notes==
* Quarterstaves can be used by all [[base class]]es.
*Some NWN manuals and documentation incorrectly list the quarterstaff as a [[double-sided weapon]]. It is a large weapon.

==Toolset==
* Quarterstaves are listed under the [[double-sided blueprint category]] of the [[Item palette]] in the [[toolset]] (even though they're not double-sided).